            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Старший брат никогда не обижал младшего. Stárshiy brat nikogdá ne obizhál mládshego. The older brother never picked on the younger one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective обидеть. Takes the accusative: обижать (obizhát) младшего."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
